s a warm glow on her skin, highlights the texture of the white bikini fabric, and casts soft, long shadows on the sand, enhancing muscle definition and curves.” }, “camera”: { “technical”: “High-resolution professional photograph. Sharp focus on the main subject. Realistic, candid beach style capture.”, “aspect_ratio”: “9:16”, “constraints”: [ “CRITICAL: The subject must have the specific EXAGGERATED hourglass physique with a tiny waist and massive glutes.”, “CRITICAL: The face must be incredibly beautiful but REALISTIC.”, “CRITICAL: There must be NO TATTOOS.”, “CRITICAL: Outfit must be a MODERN WHITE BIKINI.”, “CRITICAL: Scene must be a SEASIDE BEACH AT SUNSET.”, “The final image must be a photorealistic vertical 9:16 photograph.” ] } }

